# /etc/caddy/cloudflare.env (root:root, 0600): the environment of caddy.service.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN: a token with Zone:DNS:Edit on the zone, for the ACME DNS challenge.
# AUTHP_SHARED_KEY and AUTHP_PREVIEW_KEY (caddy-security's token keys: Everon, previews) are appended by
# caddy-install.sh; never copy them anywhere.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
